    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a truck driver. Along the way, he finds a road that is not on the map and drives along it. On the road, abandoned cars and abandoned gas stations are a place shrouded in horror, secrets and mysteries. Soon the hero realizes that someone is watching him...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the plot, exploring gloomy locations, pick up objects and move on a truck from one point to another. To get out of the forest road.\u00a0Task To get out of the forest road of horrors...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565050/extras/789c572369f316e981da9e024e8a0759.avif?t=1742724116\" width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features of the game: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric and scary sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High quality locations made on Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well-developed dialogues and history game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truck control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picking up and examining things</p></li></ul>",
